[00:13.72]1. God’s Word and all it promises
[00:22.72]Give reason to endure.
[00:25.72]The things you’ve learned and come to love
[00:28.72]Are all well-founded and sure.
[00:31.72]Be stabilized in holy faith,
[00:36.22]Keeping God’s day close in mind.
[00:40.99]Stand firm in your integrity;
[00:45.55]By tests you will be refined.
[00:52.60]2. Maintain the love you had at first,
[00:56.96]Which somehow could be lost.
[01:01.60]Despite the trials you will meet,
[01:06.10]Endure no matter the cost.
[01:10.60]Whatever test may come your way,
[01:15.10]Never yield to doubt or fear.
[01:19.87]Jehovah will provide escape,
[01:24.35]Our God ever will be near.
[01:30.81]3. All those enduring to the end
[01:35.31]Are those who will be saved.
[01:39.81]The book of life will list their names,
[01:44.31]A record clearly engraved.
[01:48.81]So let endurance be your aim;
[02:37.63]Let it have its work complete.
[02:41.79]Jehovah’s favor you will know;
[02:46.63]With joy you will be replete.